    "description": "Nippon Light Metal Holdings Company, Ltd. manufactures and sells aluminum products and related products in Japan and internationally. The company operates in four segments: Alumina, Chemical products, Bullion; Plate, Extruded products; Processed products and related businesses; and Foil and Powder Products Business. It develops and manufactures various chemicals, including alumina and aluminum hydroxide, as well as aluminum alloys; aluminum sheet metal and extruded aluminum profiles, and supplies to various fields. The company also develops and manufactures aluminum foil, powder, and paste products; and develops, manufactures, and supply products for various fields, including automobiles, truck bodies, railways, building materials, food products, and cleanrooms. Nippon Light Metal Holdings Company, Ltd. was incorporated in 2012 and is headquartered in Minato, Japan."
